      "optimizationLog": "Interchanges linear layers from column-strided (bi, o, i) to row-streaming (bi, i, o) with hoisted row offsets and 4-way column unrolling, reuses pre-allocated ping-pong Float32Array activations, and replaces per-element DataView pow2 scaling in frozen GELU with a 2,047-entry IEEE-754 exponent-bit table and unrolled Horner polynomial. Preserves ascending i = 0..W-1 Math.fround accumulation and +0 normalization (0 ULP deviation, Object.is bit-identical on both 16x128x4 and 32x512x8). Measured 2.43x over the JS Track A adapter baseline (3.3908 ms -> 1.3927 ms) and 2.78x over mlpControlled (2.5533 ms -> 0.9179 ms, arm64 macOS).",
